 "note_on_provenance": "Derived from reviewed game film, not marked blind for this project. The reviewer logs every shot for the box score without seeing any model output, so it is not biased by the detector; but it was marked to answer a different question, so treat a disagreement as worth checking rather than as a definite miss.",
